---
import '../styles/global.css';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>ZEVRAN - Craftsmanship</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Explore the stitching, edge finishing, hardware, and logo stamping of ZEVRAN leather goods." />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-ivory text-espresso font-montserrat">
    <Header />
    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto p-12 space-y-12 fade-in">
      <section class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-cormorant text-2xl mb-4">Stitching</h2>
          <div class="h-64 bg-espresso bg-opacity-10 rounded mb-4 flex items-center justify-center text-sm text-ivory">Image Placeholder</div>
          <p>Precise, durable stitching that ensures longevity without compromise.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-cormorant text-2xl mb-4">Edge Finishing</h2>
          <div class="h-64 bg-espresso bg-opacity-10 rounded mb-4 flex items-center justify-center text-sm text-ivory">Image Placeholder</div>
          <p>Clean, smooth edges finished by skilled hands for a refined look.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-cormorant text-2xl mb-4">Hardware</h2>
          <div class="h-64 bg-espresso bg-opacity-10 rounded mb-4 flex items-center justify-center text-sm text-ivory">Image Placeholder</div>
          <p>Premium hardware selected for durability and aesthetic harmony.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-cormorant text-2xl mb-4">Logo Stamping</h2>
          <div class="h-64 bg-espresso bg-opacity-10 rounded mb-4 flex items-center justify-center text-sm text-ivory">Image Placeholder</div>
          <p>Subtle stamping of the interlocking ZR monogram, a mark of authenticity.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
